    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a seat, relax, and boo-gie your way into a happy afterlife in this cozy rhythm game! You're a ghost in purgatory helping lost souls move onto the afterlife with the power of music therapy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of your patients have a story. Some are good, some are bad, but all of them are packed with emotion. It\u2019s up to you to use the power of music to help these lost souls move forward! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps you\u2019ll find out more about yourself, too, like why you\u2019re here and who you were before. Were you cool? Did you have cool friends? Did you learn any words to describe something you like other than cool? Only time will tell\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help your clients, you\u2019ll have to play some music on your trusty jukebox! Point, click, and hold the left mouse button to play the right notes. During the song, it might be a good idea to listen to your clients. You wouldn\u2019t want to play a happy song if they\u2019re depressed, or vice versa. By choosing the right emotional beats, you can get their true feelings out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the session is over and a client moves on, they\u2019ll leave a book behind on your bookshelf, allowing you to learn more about who they were.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of clients to help, with different backgrounds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching paths based on different emotions of the music notes you choose!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several soundtracks from a dedicated audio team!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing calm environment to relax to!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive musical gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reading!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!!!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a seat, relax, and boo-gie your way into a happy afterlife in this cozy rhythm game! You're a ghost in purgatory helping lost souls move onto the afterlife with the power of music therapy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of your patients have a story. Some are good, some are bad, but all of them are packed with emotion. It\u2019s up to you to use the power of music to help these lost souls move forward! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps you\u2019ll find out more about yourself, too, like why you\u2019re here and who you were before. Were you cool? Did you have cool friends? Did you learn any words to describe something you like other than cool? Only time will tell\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help your clients, you\u2019ll have to play some music on your trusty jukebox! Point, click, and hold the left mouse button to play the right notes. During the song, it might be a good idea to listen to your clients. You wouldn\u2019t want to play a happy song if they\u2019re depressed, or vice versa. By choosing the right emotional beats, you can get their true feelings out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the session is over and a client moves on, they\u2019ll leave a book behind on your bookshelf, allowing you to learn more about who they were.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of clients to help, with different backgrounds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching paths based on different emotions of the music notes you choose!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several soundtracks from a dedicated audio team!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing calm environment to relax to!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive musical gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reading!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!!!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Ghost Jukebox puts the \u201cboo\u201d in boogie, having you play all sorts of music for your clients in this cozy rhythm game. Everyone has their own afterlife journey, and it\u2019s up to you to help them complete it!",
